<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 2 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES RISE FIM 2 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to December 31 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to December 23:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 36,397	 36,396</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,626	 12,635</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,906	  1,906</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,266	  2,271</p>
<p> Total assets		     58,518	 61,152</p>
<p>In the previous week to December 23 reserves fell by 52</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
